==Explanation==
*You have five minutes to defeat as many enemies as possible.
*You have unlimited [[Battle Items#Speed Up|Speed Up]]s and [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]]s, but no other items are allowed
*The base has unlimited health and can attack Cats that are close to it.
*You gain no money for defeating enemies.
*Defeating enemies will earn you points. The number varies.
*The total points will decrease over time.

